From 1d6074892643483b34f926994258929eb486fbfb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:50:24 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Admin child page: show each document's transcript inline

- GET /api/admin/children/:childId/documents returns the cached transcript (up to 20k chars);
  documents without one are queued for extraction, the page refreshes until ready.
- Transcript view is written to the access log (at most once per 30 min per document).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B8r16QcS1qxJdA1TRkE5Kw
---
 .../src/controllers/admin.controller.ts       |  33 ++++-
 .../admin/components/ChildRecordsAdmin.tsx    | 117 ++++++++++++++----
 2 files changed, 120 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)

diff --git a/umaisense-back-main/src/controllers/admin.controller.ts b/umaisense-back-main/src/controllers/admin.controller.ts
index 9f6741b..c9577a5 100644
--- a/umaisense-back-main/src/controllers/admin.controller.ts
+++ b/umaisense-back-main/src/controllers/admin.controller.ts
